WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.913
A group boxes related conversations together.

2
00:00:08.913 --> 00:00:16.315
A git worktree is a workspace with its own branch and folder.

3
00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:22.837
A conversation started in it runs in the worktree.

4
00:00:22.837 --> 00:00:26.442
Its panel commits the work, or fast-forwards tally to it.
